flowchart LR
  subgraph External_VCS [Version Control System]
    GP[GitHub / GitLab VCS]
    HR[Human Engineer Sign-Off]
  end

  subgraph Ingestion [Ingestion & Queuing]
    WG[Webhook Ingestion Gateway]
    EQ[(PR Review Job Queue)]
  end

  subgraph Processing [Analysis & Orchestration]
    DFS[AST Semantic Diff Parser]
    RO[Review & Remediation Orchestrator]
    LLM[[LLM Remediation API]]
  end

  subgraph Verification [Sandbox & Security]
    SM[Ephemeral Sandbox Runner]
    GPG[GPG Patch Signer]
    AV[(Immutable Audit Vault)]
  end

  GP -->|PR Ready-for-Review| WG
  WG -->|Enqueue Task| EQ
  EQ -->|Fetch Job| DFS
  DFS -->|Parsed AST Chunks| RO
  RO -->|Prompt Context| LLM
  LLM -->|Proposed Patch| RO
  RO -->|Run Repo Tests| SM
  SM -->|Test Status & Metrics| RO
  RO -->|Record Trail| AV
  RO -->|Verified Patch| GPG
  GPG -->|Suggested Commit & Explanations| GP
  GP -->|Interactive Diff & Safety Score| HR
  HR -->|Manual Approve / Merge| GP